on, the velocity vector at time $t$ can be found using\n\n$$\nv=u+at,\n$$\n\nwhere $u$ is the initial velocity, and $a$ is the acceleration of the particle.\n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\nu=i-7j,\\,a=3i+4j.\n$$\n\nTherefore, after $t=3\\,\\text{h},$ the velocity of the particle will be\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =u+at \\\\  & =(i-7j)+(3i+4j)(3) \\\\  & =(i-7j)+(9i+12j) \\\\  & =(10i+5j)\\,\\text{km/h}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361103 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361104 13194139535684 true] [17592186361103 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361105 13194139535684 true] [17592186361103 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535684 true] [17592186361103 1041 "field-1" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361103 1104 #edb/ref 17592186361105 13194139535684 true] [17592186361103 1110 #uuid "9864669d-3663-5efa-b110-21c72e4f012f" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361104 1034 "9" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361104 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535684 true] [17592186361104 1111 #uuid "cf0c6569-b17d-53b0-9d11-9321cd6b03de" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361105 1034 "10" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361105 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535684 true] [17592186361105 1111 #uuid "a814644e-e7d3-5580-b29c-d71dc4b9fc98" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361106 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361107 13194139535684 true] [17592186361106 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535684 true] [17592186361106 1041 "field-2" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361106 1104 #edb/ref 17592186361107 13194139535684 true] [17592186361106 1110 #uuid "081175e1-2b61-51d8-b6bf-b68234096e27" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361107 1034 "5" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361107 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535684 true] [17592186361107 1111 #uuid "9affb070-f3c9-5f0d-9ebf-43598baf8c8d" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361108 1017 #edb/ref 17592186361109 13194139535684 true] [17592186361108 1017 #edb/ref 17592186361111 13194139535684 true] [17592186361108 1089 "q-318175" 13194139535684 true] [17592186361108 1091 #edb/ref 17592186